<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Health Sync - Login</title>
    <style>
            * {
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                box-sizing: border-box;
                font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            }

            body {
                min-height: 100vh;
                display: flex;
                justify-content: center;
                align-items: center;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00ffcc 0%, #33cccc 100%);
            }

            .container {
                width: 90%;
                max-width: 1200px;
                height: 600px;
                background: white;
                border-radius: 20px;
                display: flex;
                overflow: hidden;
                box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            }

            .left-side {
                width: 40%;
                padding: 40px;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
                background: #f8f8f8;
            }

            .logo {
                width: 120px;
                margin-bottom: 30px;
            }

            h1 {
                color: #333;
                font-size: 2.5em;
                margin-bottom: 20px;
            }

            .subtitle {
                color: #666;
                margin-bottom: 30px;
                line-height: 1.5;
            }

            .cadastro-btn {
                padding: 14px 35px;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00ffcc 0%, #33cccc 100%);
                border: none;
                color: white;
                border-radius: 25px;
                font-size: 1.1em;
                font-weight: 600;
                cursor: pointer;
                transition: all 0.3s ease;
                text-decoration: none;
                display: inline-block;
                box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 204, 204, 0.3);
            }

            .cadastro-btn:hover {
                transform: translateY(-2px);
                box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 204, 204, 0.4);
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #33cccc 0%, #00ffcc 100%);
            }

            .right-side {
                width: 60%;
                padding: 40px;
                position: relative;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .login-container {
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 400px;
                margin: 0 auto;
            }

            h2 {
                color: #333;
                font-size: 1.5em;
                margin-bottom: 30px;
            }

            .input-group {
                margin-bottom: 20px;
            }

            label {
                display: block;
                color: #666;
                margin-bottom: 8px;
            }

            input {
                width: 100%;
                padding: 12px;
                border: 1px solid #ddd;
                border-radius: 8px;
                font-size: 1em;
                transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
            }

            input:focus {
                outline: none;
                border-color: #00ffcc;
            }

            .entrar-btn {
                width: 100%;
                padding: 12px;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00ffcc 0%, #33cccc 100%);
                border: none;
                border-radius: 8px;
                color: white;
                font-size: 1em;
                cursor: pointer;
                transition: background 0.3s ease;
            }

            .entrar-btn:hover {
                background: #00cccc;
            }

            .enfermeiro {
                position: absolute;
                bottom: 0;
                right: 0;
                height: 250px;
                pointer-events: none;
            }

            @media (max-width: 768px) {
                .container {
                    flex-direction: column;
                    height: auto;
                }

                .left-side, .right-side {
                    width: 100%;
                }

                .enfermeiro {
                    display: none;
                }
            } 
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="left-side">
            <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Logo Health Sync" class="logo">
            <h1>Bem vindo</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Primeira vez em nosso app? Faça o cadastro clicando no botão "Cadastre-se".</p>
            <a href="/cadastro" class="cadastro-btn">Cadastre-se</a>
        </div>
        <div class="right-side">
            <div class="login-container">
                <h2>Acesse sua conta Health Sync utilizando email e senha.</h2>
                <form action="/login" class="space-y-6" method="post">
                    <div class="input-group">
                        <label for="email">Email:</label>
                        <input name="email" type="email" id="email" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="input-group">
                        <label for="senha">Senha:</label>
                        <input name="senha" type="password" id="senha" required>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit" class="entrar-btn">Entrar</button>
                </form>
            </div>
            <img src="/images/enfermeiro.png" alt="Enfermeiro" class="enfermeiro">
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html> 